WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 1, Scene 28h: Sorceress Memorial or Odine's Laboratory
Duration: ~8 seconds
Source: FF8 Gameplay/Cutscene
Describes a facility related to the Sorceress Memorial or Dr. Odine's Laboratory

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
A vast chamber is revealed. At its center stands the Sorceress Memorial — a massive crystal coffin suspended in the air, held aloft by invisible forces or energy fields. The crystalline structure is translucent and ethereal, glowing faintly with blue light from within.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Alternatively, the scene shows Dr. Odine's Laboratory — workstations covered with bizarre equipment, crystalline structures, and machinery of impossible purpose. Blue energy arcs between devices. The walls are lined with monitoring stations and data displays.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The party approaches the chamber, understanding they've reached a critical location. The technology here is beyond anything they've encountered — the very air seems to thrumm with power and purpose.
